        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Sudoku Fun Anytime, Anywhere!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SmartNumberPlace</strong> makes sudoku accessible and enjoyable for everyone. Relax and exercise your brain at your own pace!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✨ Beginner-Friendly Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New to sudoku? We've got you covered! Enjoy traditional memo functions plus <strong>automatic candidate display</strong> and other helpful tools for stress-free puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle has <strong>exactly one solution</strong>—no trick questions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎨 Customize Your Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize <strong>backgrounds and color themes</strong> to create your perfect puzzle space. Soothing <strong>BGM</strong> enhances focus while keeping you relaxed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>♾️ Endless Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-generated puzzles</strong> mean infinite fresh challenges. You'll never see the same puzzle twice!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⏱️ Perfect for Any Moment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commute, coffee break, or bedtime—turn your spare moments into meaningful relaxation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump into a new world of sudoku with SmartNumberPlace!</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Sudoku Fun Anytime, Anywhere!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SmartNumberPlace</strong> makes sudoku accessible and enjoyable for everyone. Relax and exercise your brain at your own pace!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✨ Beginner-Friendly Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New to sudoku? We've got you covered! Enjoy traditional memo functions plus <strong>automatic candidate display</strong> and other helpful tools for stress-free puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle has <strong>exactly one solution</strong>—no trick questions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎨 Customize Your Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize <strong>backgrounds and color themes</strong> to create your perfect puzzle space. Soothing <strong>BGM</strong> enhances focus while keeping you relaxed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>♾️ Endless Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-generated puzzles</strong> mean infinite fresh challenges. You'll never see the same puzzle twice!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⏱️ Perfect for Any Moment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commute, coffee break, or bedtime—turn your spare moments into meaningful relaxation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump into a new world of sudoku with SmartNumberPlace!</strong></p>",
